@pat.kids.arith.sw.buy.mod core.pattern
    match="[just_so_you_know|by_the_way|did_you_know|know_that|guess_what|fun_fact|oh_and|remember_that|note_that|fyi|btw|so|ok|well|look|listen|note|hey|oh|and|also|remember|update|news|um|uh|yesterday|today|earlier|then|later|meanwhile|next|now|first|finally]? {who:agent} [just_now|right_now|just|also|already|then|now|today|yesterday|earlier|only|recently|quickly|finally|really|again|later|first|even|too|still|once|suddenly]? [just_now|right_now|just|also|already|then|now|today|yesterday|earlier|only|recently|quickly|finally|really|again|later|first|even|too|still|once|suddenly]? [has|have|had|did|will]? [just]? [picked_up|has_bought|has_purchased|have_bought|had_bought|did_buy|did_purchase|buys|bought|buy|purchases|purchased|buying|grabbed|ordered|orders] {n:number} [more|new|extra|another]? {item:lex.kids.arith.items} [from_the_shop|from_the_store|at_the_shop|at_the_store|from_a_friend|in_the_shop|in_the_store|at_the_market|from_the_market|on_the_way|just_now|as_well|at_school|at_home|from_home|after_school|at_lunch|for_lunch|for_dinner|so_far|in_total|now|today|already|yesterday|earlier|too|again|there|here|then|later|more]? [from_the_shop|from_the_store|at_the_shop|at_the_store|from_a_friend|in_the_shop|in_the_store|at_the_market|from_the_market|on_the_way|just_now|as_well|at_school|at_home|from_home|after_school|at_lunch|for_lunch|for_dinner|so_far|in_total|now|today|already|yesterday|earlier|too|again|there|here|then|later|more]?"
